votes cast with respect to the proposal to approve the amendment of the Certificate of Incorporation, which approval is contingent upon
stockholder approval of, and the effectuation of, the Reverse Stock Split, to reduce the total number of authorized shares of our common
stock from 490,000,000 shares to 100,000,000 shares, were as follows:</span></td>
</tr></table>
